The DevOps Knowledge Hub is a comprehensive and interactive web application built to simplify the learning journey of DevOps enthusiasts. It brings together multiple elements of the DevOps lifecycle into one clean and user-friendly platform. Learners can explore step-by-step tutorials on core topics like Continuous Integration/Continuous Delivery (CI/CD), Infrastructure as Code (IaC), and Monitoring practices. A built-in simulated terminal allows users to try common DevOps commands in a safe environment, reinforcing practical knowledge without the need for external tools. The app also provides mini quizzes to test understanding, helping learners track their progress while keeping the experience engaging. In addition, the resources section acts as a curated library where users can contribute useful links and references. Designed as a single-page application with responsive layout and light/dark theme toggle, the DevOps Knowledge Hub is not just a learning tool but also a showcase of how DevOps concepts can be visualized and practiced interactively.
